OL,3,GNEWSAProduction ends at historical
OL,4,AKellogg's factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FProduction at the Kellogg's factory in
OL,7,FGreater Manchester has come to an end
OL,8,Fafter almost 90 years, with the loss of
OL,9,Fabout 360 jobs.
OL,11,FThe site in Trafford Park was one of
OL,12,Fthe largest cereal factories in Europe
OL,13,Fwhen built in 1938 but production is
OL,14,Fbeing transferred to the company's site
OL,15,Fin Wrexham, north Wales.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
