OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProduction ends at historical
OL,4,AKellogg's factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for owners Kellanova
OL,7,Fsaid the site has been a crucial part
OL,8,Fof its success for decades, adding: "We
OL,9,Fthank everyone who has worked there, as
OL,10,Fwell as the suppliers, partners and
OL,11,Flocal community who have worked
OL,12,Falongside us."
OL,14,FMick Murray from retail union Usdaw
OL,15,Fsaid it was "a sad time" after working
OL,16,Fto "try to secure the best possible
OL,17,Foutcome for our members".
